// MMA on Pyodide - sample song.
//
// Note the groove references below name the library file explicitly
// ("stdlib/swing:Swing"). This is deliberate: the groove database
// (.mmaDB) is not shipped in the wheel, and bare names like "Groove Swing"
// need it. Naming the file works everywhere.

Tempo 120
Time 4/4

Groove stdlib/swing:Swing
C Am F G
C Am F G

Groove stdlib/swing:SwingEnd
C
